It wasn't previously required to check MemberAccessExpressions for warnings because the diagnostic was always on the entire InvocationExpressionsSyntax, but with the changes to the trim analyzer, the warnings will be on the MemberAccessExpression instead.

```csharp
// IL2026 location before
{|MethodWithRuc(arg1, arg1)|};
// IL2026 location after
{|MethodWithRuc|}(arg1, arg1);
```
